1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,910
Empezamos en el sudeste de Asia,

2
00:00:02,060 --> 00:00:02,870
en Camboya:

3
00:00:02,980 --> 00:00:05,210
el a-ping, salado y crocante,

4
00:00:05,260 --> 00:00:07,510
una tarántula frita que se sirve con hierbas

5
00:00:07,520 --> 00:00:08,790
frescas sobre arroz.

6
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:09,850
Subimos a Nepal:

7
00:00:09,960 --> 00:00:12,210
el thekua, dulce y crujiente,

8
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:13,730
una masa de harina integral,

9
00:00:13,980 --> 00:00:15,850
melaza y coco frita en ghee,

10
00:00:15,980 --> 00:00:17,910
típica del festival Chhath Puja.

11
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:19,190
Seguimos al Cáucaso,

12
00:00:19,280 --> 00:00:19,970
a Armenia:

13
00:00:20,120 --> 00:00:22,530
el chechil, un queso salado de vaca,

14
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:24,930
trenzado en finas tiras y a veces ahumado,

15
00:00:24,940 --> 00:00:26,690
que se sirve junto a una cerveza.

16
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:28,530
Viajamos al norte de Europa,

17
00:00:28,680 --> 00:00:29,410
a Suecia:

18
00:00:29,480 --> 00:00:30,770
el toast skagen,

19
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:32,110
salado y cremoso,

20
00:00:32,120 --> 00:00:33,630
una tostada con camarones,

21
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:35,290
mayonesa y huevas de pescado,

22
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:36,670
con eneldo y limón.

23
00:00:36,680 --> 00:00:38,490
Bajamos hasta África Occidental,

24
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:39,410
a Senegal:

25
00:00:39,580 --> 00:00:40,550
el thiebou yapp,

26
00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:41,970
salado y especiado,

27
00:00:42,040 --> 00:00:44,150
arroz con carne y verduras que suele llevar

28
00:00:44,160 --> 00:00:45,770
huevo duro y aceitunas.

29
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:47,150
Y terminamos en Kenia:

30
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:49,370
el mukimo, salado y rústico,

31
00:00:49,480 --> 00:00:50,390
un puré de papa,

32
00:00:50,580 --> 00:00:52,510
maíz y legumbres que se come con carne

33
00:00:52,520 --> 00:00:53,290
a la parrilla.

